<title>ITALY: Fiat, Italy car registrations fell in November.</title>
<headline>Fiat, Italy car registrations fell in November.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian carmaker Fiat showed a 17.1 percent fall in new car registrations in November to 61,150 from levels seen in November 1995. The figure covers all car marques owned by the Fiat Group.</p>
<p>Earlier, the Italian Ministry of Transport said that Italian new car registrations in November fell 11.44 percent to 134,000 compared with 151,313 registrations in November 1995.</p>
</text>
